Package: bikesmart
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-17
Title: Bike-Share Quality Control, Predictive Dock Balancing, and Maintenance Analytics
Authors@R: c(
  person("Big Red Crew", email = "sixsigma@cornell.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")) )
Author: Big Red Crew [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Big Red Crew <sixsigma@cornell.edu>
Description: Comprehensive quality control, reliability analysis, and predictive
    rebalancing toolkit for micro-mobility bike-share networks. Provides tools
    for: (1) calculating arrival-time dock inventory projections and distance-based
    recommendations with rebalancing incentives; (2) modeling usable fleet reliability
    using multiplicative failure factors (rolled throughput survival); (3) attribute
    Statistical Process Control (P-chart) with sample-size-dependent 3-sigma limits
    to monitor fleet defect rates; and (4) operational maintenance dispatch ranking
    and stuck-bike anomaly detection. Developed for the Cornell Six Sigma Hackathon.
